{"code":0,"message":"OK","timestamp":"1795150252","data":{"catalog":[{"id":"1","name":"终末地百科","status":2,"position":1,"typeSub":[{"id":"1","name":"干员","fatherTypeId":"1","style":1,"status":2,"position":1,"icon":"","items":[{"itemId":"2503","name":"明河","lang":"zh_Hans","brief":{"cover":"https://bbs.hycdn.cn/image/common/20261105/736412/6aebf6197c212eb1c6154d24_3eac6ad0.png","name":"明河","description":null,"associate":{"id":"0e691c08a09d81bc7f8fa14a1cb03561","name":"明河","type":"char","dotType":"label_type_up"},"dotType":"label_type_up","subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10000","value":"10006"},{"subTypeId":"10100","value":"10102"},{"subTypeId":"10200","value":"10201"},{"subTypeId":"10207","value":"10212"},{"subTypeId":"10208","value":"10219"},{"subTypeId":"10209","value":"10221"}],"composite":null,"disableCoverShowInDetail":false,"redirectLink":"","redirectLinkMobile":""},"status":2,"tagIds":["10201","10006","10102","10212","10219","10221"],"publishedAtTs":"1793852260","caption":[{"kind":"text","text":{"text":"“执锐披坚，就不讲点到为止了。”"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"text":" "}},{"kind":"text","text":{"text":"炎国禁军，宏山科学院靖天都尉夜明河，执开天剑势，与他的驰兽怒骊奔若惊雷，驰骋北方前线，留下传说无数。然而传说之外的他，却并不像人们口中那般不近人情。行过山川，遇见寻常小事，他总愿意伸手相助。"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"text":" "}},{"kind":"text","text":{"text":"他鲜少提及往事，旧日传闻却仍留在人们口中：他的剑势，正是因你改变。"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"text":" "}},{"kind":"text","text":{"text":"此身为剑，心不为锋。你曾给他的答案，已照亮漫漫长夜。往后，他仍将在谈天师麾下为塔卫二奔走，解决种种危难；也将执剑与终末地同行，为文明开辟前路，直到万家灯火再不受灾厄侵扰。"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"text":" "}},{"kind":"text","text":{"text":"“当下决断之时，我一定会在您身边，您大可相信你我之间的默契。”"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"text":" "}}]},{"itemId":"2338","name":"祀","lang":"zh_Hans","brief":{"cover":"https://bbs.hycdn.cn/image/common/20261014/4826366/6acf92a9b8edfebe3af524e0_56331367.png","name":"祀","description":null,"associate":{"id":"38bc410d7e134743ed8ee881d8400833","name":"祀","type":"char","dotType":""},"dotType":"","subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10000","value":"10006"},{"subTypeId":"10100","value":"10103"},{"subTypeId":"10200","value":"10206"},{"subTypeId":"10207","value":"10217"},{"subTypeId":"10208","value":"10216"},{"subTypeId":"10209","value":"10221"}],"composite":null,"disableCoverShowInDetail":false,"redirectLink":"","redirectLinkMobile":""},"status":2,"tagIds":["10206","10006","10103","10217","10216","10221"],"publishedAtTs":"1791290181","caption":[{"kind":"text","text":{"text":"“哼，惹了麻烦，才想起来找我？”"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"text":" "}},{"kind":"text","text":{"text":"祀是塔卫二上极少数的巨兽代理人之一。所谓巨兽，乃是泰拉原生的超因果生物，而祂们沉眠时显现于人前的意识，便被称作巨兽代理人。祀与其巨兽的关系有些复杂，不过出于习惯，人们依旧称呼她为巨兽代理人 。可实际上，祀并非谁的代理，她只是她自己。隐藏在那份强大与神秘下的，是一个仍对世界抱有希望与好奇心的年轻灵魂。"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"text":" "}},{"kind":"text","text":{"text":"平日里，她会动用自己的能力，为宏科院与终末地提供全面支持。闲暇之余，她也会在塔卫二的各个城市中，追寻前沿科技与时尚潮流。随心所欲，无拘无束。"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"text":" "}},{"kind":"text","text":{"text":"“再帮你一把，回客栈了记得找我清账。”"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"text":" "}}]}],"filterTagTree":[{"id":"10200","children":[{"id":"10201","children":[],"name":"近卫","type":4,"value":"profession_guard","hide":false},{"id":"10202","children":[],"name":"术师","type":4,"value":"profession_caster","hide":false},{"id":"10203","children":[],"name":"突击","type":4,"value":"profession_assault","hide":false},{"id":"10204","children":[],"name":"先锋","type":4,"value":"profession_vanguard","hide":false},{"id":"10205","children":[],"name":"重装","type":4,"value":"profession_defender","hide":false},{"id":"10206","children":[],"name":"辅助","type":4,"value":"profession_supporter","hide":false}],"name":"干员职业","type":4,"value":"","hide":false},{"id":"10000","children":[{"id":"10001","children":[],"name":"1星","type":2,"value":"rarity_1","hide":false},{"id":"10002","children":[],"name":"2星","type":2,"value":"rarity_2","hide":false},{"id":"10003","children":[],"name":"3星","type":2,"value":"rarity_3","hide":false},{"id":"10004","children":[],"name":"4星","type":2,"value":"rarity_4","hide":false},{"id":"10005","children":[],"name":"5星","type":2,"value":"rarity_5","hide":false},{"id":"10006","children":[],"name":"6星"